# Copy to .kentaro/workspace/llm.env. This file is ignored by Git. Add only
# the variable named by `apiKeyEnv` in generation.yaml. Do not add LLM keys to
# .kentaro/workspace/maysano.env; it is reserved for the Maysano read API.
#
# Example for the OpenAI configuration in generation.example.yaml:
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
